{"id":"abgerissen","lemma":"abgerissen","pos":"adj","rank":4909,"glosses":["ragged, tattered","seedy","demolished"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/6/61/De-abgerissen.ogg/De-abgerissen.ogg.mp3","forms":{"comparative":"abgerissener","superlative":"am abgerissensten"},"examples":[{"text":"Das alte Haus wurde abgerissen.","en":"The old house was demolished.","words":[{"g":"the / that"},{"g":"age, old age","l":"Alter"},{"g":"house, building"},{"g":"to become","l":"werden"},null]},{"text":"Dieses Haus soll abgerissen werden.","en":"This house has been condemned.","words":[{"g":"this one, this","l":"dieser"},{"g":"house, building"},{"g":"should","l":"sollen"},null,{"g":"to become"}]},{"text":"Das Gebäude wird abgerissen.","en":"The building is being demolished.","words":[{"g":"the / that"},{"g":"building"},{"g":"to become","l":"werden"},null]},{"text":"Einige alte Gebäude müssen abgerissen werden.","en":"A few old buildings need to be demolished.","words":[{"g":"united","l":"einig"},{"g":"age, old age","l":"Alter"},{"g":"building"},{"g":"to have to"},null,{"g":"to become"}]},{"text":"Das alte Haus wird in zwei Tagen abgerissen.","en":"They will tear down the old building in two days.","words":[{"g":"the / that"},{"g":"age, old age","l":"Alter"},{"g":"house, building"},{"g":"to become","l":"werden"},{"g":"in"},{"g":"two (numerical value…"},{"g":"to meet"},null]}]}